cmd-seeghosts-desc = Shows ghosts to you and only you. Unlike showghosts this affects no other player and can be turned back off.
cmd-seeghosts-help = Usage: {$command} [true/false]. Omit the argument to toggle.
cmd-seeghosts-hint = <true/false>
cmd-seeghosts-enabled = You can now see ghosts. Nobody else's view changed.
cmd-seeghosts-disabled = You can no longer see ghosts.
cmd-seeghosts-already-ghost = Ghosts already see other ghosts. Attach to a non-ghost entity to use this command.
cmd-seeghosts-no-eye = Your attached entity has no eye and cannot use private ghost vision.
